<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 7,000 MT were primarily for Saudi Arabia (6,900 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 65,900 MT were six and one-half times the 4-week average.  The destinations were Saudi Arabia (56,900 MT), Japan (5,700 MT), and Mexico (3,300 MT).</p>
</text>
